{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/40c8ee98aae8feab831a7f91fe97b73d.avif?t=1761535766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras_big/40c8ee98aae8feab831a7f91fe97b73d.avif?t=1761535766 width=800 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHANTASMAGORIA UPDATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Phantasmagoria update for Halloween has brought a massive overhaul to the camera and the environments, to completely change the experience of playing the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Happy Halloween! :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE MONSTALKERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/41615bfa1d7b5fd826ab64099b9beea2.poster.avif?t=1761535766\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/41615bfa1d7b5fd826ab64099b9beea2.webm?t=1761535766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/41615bfa1d7b5fd826ab64099b9beea2.mp4?t=1761535766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Scary creatures started haunting your nightmares. Your doctor tells you to look for Memory Fragments hidden within your mind to figure out : what's causing these visions exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/19bbe5bb49a0bd540f693d8fd508d827.poster.avif?t=1761535766\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/19bbe5bb49a0bd540f693d8fd508d827.webm?t=1761535766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/19bbe5bb49a0bd540f693d8fd508d827.mp4?t=1761535766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find these mysterious objects, you'll have to navigate dark hostile corridors... Be weary! As when your light runs out, the MonStalkers will start to chase you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/2724510b01edcf3581e1e31238ceb6a2.poster.avif?t=1761535766\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/2724510b01edcf3581e1e31238ceb6a2.webm?t=1761535766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/2724510b01edcf3581e1e31238ceb6a2.mp4?t=1761535766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Filled with traps, these grounds are dangerous. It has been said that many who roamed too deep inside of them never returned with their full sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face your fears?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645430?t=1761535766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645430?t=1761535766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/c86956c004feb9655dbeb1ce4369dfc0b50fb205/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761535766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/c86956c004feb9655dbeb1ce4369dfc0b50fb205/capsule_184